{
  "file_id": "3560",
  "text_count": 70,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "No one's around. Tentomon, come\nover here!",
      "_offset": 1353,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Right-o!",
      "_offset": 1396,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "*whew*",
      "_offset": 1405,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "So this is your place, Izzy?",
      "_offset": 1412,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Y-Yes?",
      "_offset": 1446,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "W-What are we gonna do?!",
      "_offset": 1453,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Please, hide!",
      "_offset": 1478,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Ah? You're home.",
      "_offset": 1492,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "I-I'm home! Camp was cancelled.",
      "_offset": 1509,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Really?",
      "_offset": 1541,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "What's wrong?",
      "_offset": 1549,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Nothing's wrong.",
      "_offset": 1563,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "I see...",
      "_offset": 1580,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "*whew*",
      "_offset": 1589,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Hey, it's the first time you're\nseein' her in a while. Aren't'cha\nbein' a bit blunt?",
      "_offset": 1596,
      "_length": 84,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "No, that's not...",
      "_offset": 1681,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Hey, dear. When are we going to\ntell him the truth?",
      "_offset": 1699,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Why don't we wait a bit longer? If\nwe tell Izzy now, it'll be a\nreally big shock.",
      "_offset": 1751,
      "_length": 86,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "But I wonder if he's already\nrealized it by now...",
      "_offset": 1838,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "That he's not our real son. That\nhe's adopted...",
      "_offset": 1889,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Did something happen?",
      "_offset": 1938,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Nothing in particular, but...",
      "_offset": 1960,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Izzy... Izzy!",
      "_offset": 1990,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "You 'kay?",
      "_offset": 2014,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Yeah.",
      "_offset": 2024,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Looks like we've received an\ne-mail... from Gennai?!",
      "_offset": 2030,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "What happened?",
      "_offset": 2083,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "This is bad! An unidentified\nDigimon has landed in Shibaura!",
      "_offset": 2098,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "What?!",
      "_offset": 2159,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Is this Shibaura Wharf?",
      "_offset": 2166,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Yes, according to Gennai...",
      "_offset": 2190,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "...the unidentified Digimon\nshould have landed here.",
      "_offset": 2218,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "I'd feel right better 'bout this\nif the others were here, but...",
      "_offset": 2271,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Everyone should be asleep right\nnow.",
      "_offset": 2336,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Can't help it. I'll just have to\nwing it on my own some way.",
      "_offset": 2373,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Yes!",
      "_offset": 2434,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "W-what's that!?",
      "_offset": 2439,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "I-it's over there!",
      "_offset": 2455,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "That's Raremon!",
      "_offset": 2474,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Ugh! What's that smell...",
      "_offset": 2490,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "It's comin' this-a-way!",
      "_offset": 2516,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "We have to do something before he\nturns around and notices us!",
      "_offset": 2540,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Let's go, Tentomon!",
      "_offset": 2603,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Got it!",
      "_offset": 2623,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "We did it, Tentomon!",
      "_offset": 2631,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "We managed to floor him by\nourselves...",
      "_offset": 2652,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Ah! The Digivice!",
      "_offset": 2692,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "What's going on?!",
      "_offset": 2710,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "The eighth child must be nearby!",
      "_offset": 2728,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Ah! You're...",
      "_offset": 2761,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Ah! PicoDevimon!",
      "_offset": 2775,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "You aren't chasing the eighth\nchild's signal, are you?!",
      "_offset": 2792,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "We won't letcha have the eighth\nChosen Child!",
      "_offset": 2848,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "Gh... I'll remember this!",
      "_offset": 2894,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "He left.",
      "_offset": 2920,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "We're safe for now, Tentomon.",
      "_offset": 2929,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "So, what 'bout the eighth child's\nsignal?",
      "_offset": 2959,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "Right! Ah, the signal's\nvanishing...",
      "_offset": 3001,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Right shame.",
      "_offset": 3038,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "But at least now we know the\neighth child isn't around\nKarigaoka...",
      "_offset": 3051,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "We've learned enough. It seems\nthat Tai's suspicions were\ncorrect.",
      "_offset": 3121,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Right.",
      "_offset": 3191,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "T-that's...",
      "_offset": 3198,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "What's wrong, Izzy?",
      "_offset": 3210,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "I just saw a cat over there that\nlooks similar to Tai's cat.",
      "_offset": 3235,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Wonder what it's doin' over\nhere...",
      "_offset": 3299,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "I don't know. Maybe it hid some\nfood around here?",
      "_offset": 3335,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "I'm gettin' kinda hungry.",
      "_offset": 3385,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "Hahaha. I'll bring you something\nwhen we get home.",
      "_offset": 3411,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Sorry 'bout that.",
      "_offset": 3462,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}